version: v1.0.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/tvquynh/5g-nidd-cross-station"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility artifact for a study of what cross-station evaluation reports
  on the 5G-NIDD intrusion detection dataset. Ships the pipeline for four
  evaluation protocols, the 652 per-cell result records behind every reported
  number, the aggregation scripts that regenerate each table and figure without
  retraining, tests covering the protocol definitions and the statistical
  treatment, and a record audit that fails if the run total departs from the
  figure the article reports. The 5G-NIDD dataset is distributed by its own
  authors and is not redistributed here.
